    "type": "question",
    "label": "10",
    "prompt": "Factor $x^4+x^2+1$ by adding and subtracting $x^2$.",
    "layout": "list",
    "columns": null,
    "questionDiagrams": [],
    "children": [],
    "answer": {
      "short": "$(x^2-x+1)(x^2+x+1)$\n\nForm $(x^2+1)^2-x^2$, then use the difference of squares.",
      "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}x^4+x^2+1&=x^4+2x^2+1-x^2\\\\x^4+x^2+1&=(x^2+1)^2-x^2\\\\x^4+x^2+1&=(x^2+1-x)(x^2+1+x)\\\\x^4+x^2+1&=(x^2-x+1)(x^2+x+1)\\end{align*}$$",
      "solutionDiagrams": []
    },
